  "description" : "Normalize optical reflectance from the observed sun/view geometry to a reference geometry (nadir view by default) with the Ross-Thick + Li-Sparse-Reciprocal kernels. Requires per-band kernel weights and sun/view angles (parameters or SICNU_* metadata); refuses when the geometry or weights are missing/nonphysical.",
