  "id" : "rs:brdf_normalization",
  "input" : "raster",
  "notes" : "Ross-Thick + Li-Sparse-Reciprocal (Lucht et al. 2000); single-pass streaming; bit-exact grade (single-threaded, fixed order). Kernel weights are band-specific physical quantities \u2014 derive them from multi-angle observations or published per-biome values; do not guess.",
